[agent] ## Summary
[agent] Created feature group **`scores9c59bf` (version 1)** on Hopsworks with exactly the required schema and 80 rows (one per account), all computed **on the platform**:
[agent] | Property | Value |
[agent] |---|---|
[agent] | Record key | `account_id` |
